{"resultsCount": 1, "resultsLimit": 10, "resultsOffset": 0, "headlines": [{"id": 50246032, "nowId": "1-50246032", "contentKey": "50246032-1-5-1", "dataSourceIdentifier": "772f3fb190697", "publishedkey": "50246032", "type": "HeadlineNews", "feedDisplayType": "Default", "headline": "Kylian Mbappé scores 100th goal for Real Madrid in dramatic Clásico win", "description": "Kylian Mbappé has scored his 100th goal for Real Madrid.", "title": "Mbappé scores 100th goal for Madrid in dramatic Clásico win", "linkText": "Mbappé scores 100th Madrid goal in Clásico win over Barcelona", "categorized": "2026-10-25T22:14:27Z", "originallyPosted": "2026-10-25T22:01:00Z", "lastModified": "2026-10-25T22:14:27Z", "published": "2026-10-25T22:14:27Z", "root": "soccer", "section": "Soccer", "images": [{"dataSourceIdentifier": "930042840bc3b", "id": 50280443, "type": "header", "name": "Kylian Mbappe [1296x729]", "alt": "Kylian Mbappe celebrates.", "credit": "(Photo by Lluis GENE / AFP via Getty Images)", "height": 729, "width": 1296, "url": "https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/1025/r1736100_1296x729_16-9.jpg"}], "categories": [{"id": 81497, "type": "league", "uid": "s:600", "guid": "119cfa41-71d4-39bf-a790-6273a52b0259", "description": "Soccer", "sportId": 600, "leagueId": 600, "league": {"id": 600, "description": "Soccer", "links": {"mobile": {"leagues": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/"}}, "web": {"leagues": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/"}}}}}, {"id": 233179, "type": "athlete", "uid": "s:600~a:231388", "guid": "61edbcca-c316-afde-575f-d9dd69176cc4", "description": "Kylian Mbappé", "sportId": 600, "athleteId": 231388, "athlete": {"id": 231388, "description": "Kylian Mbappé", "links": {"mobile": {"athletes": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/231388/kylian-mbappe"}}, "web": {"athletes": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/231388/kylian-mbappe"}}}}}, {"id": 142464, "type": "team", "uid": "s:600~t:86", "guid": "66434654-a8ba-a04c-98e5-6bbd0dbbb780", "description": "Real Madrid", "sportId": 600, "teamId": 86, "team": {"id": 86, "description": "Real Madrid", "abbreviation": "RMA", "shortDisplayName": "Real Madrid", "links": {"mobile": {"teams": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/club/_/id/86/real-madrid"}}, "web": {"teams": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/club/_/id/86/real-madrid"}}}}}, {"id": 137787, "type": "league", "uid": "s:600~l:740", "guid": "cf7b0c51-7c48-3e9a-8abb-0c01b1a973a0", "description": "Spanish LALIGA", "sportId": 600, "leagueId": 15, "league": {"id": 740, "description": "Spanish LALIGA", "abbreviation": "LALIGA", "links": {"mobile": {"leagues": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/league/_/name/esp.1"}}, "web": {"leagues": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/league/_/name/esp.1"}}}}}, {"id": 142473, "type": "team", "uid": "s:600~t:83", "guid": "58f7c4a9-c991-4ed4-fe5c-1f833cba75b8", "description": "Barcelona", "sportId": 600, "teamId": 83, "team": {"id": 83, "description": "Barcelona", "abbreviation": "BAR", "shortDisplayName": "Barcelona", "links": {"mobile": {"teams": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/club/_/id/83/barcelona"}}, "web": {"teams": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/club/_/id/83/barcelona"}}}}}], "keywords": ["Soccer", "Kylian Mbappé", "Real Madrid", "Spanish LALIGA", "Barcelona"], "story": "<p><a data-player-guid=\"61edbcca-c316-afde-575f-d9dd69176cc4\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/231388/kylian-mbappe\">Kylian Mbappé</a> scored his 100th goal for <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"66434654-a8ba-a04c-98e5-6bbd0dbbb780\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/team?id=86\">Real Madrid</a> to give his side a dramatic 2-1 Clásico win over <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"58f7c4a9-c991-4ed4-fe5c-1f833cba75b8\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/team?id=83\">Barcelona</a> on Sunday. </p>\n<p>The record goal from Mbappé came in the 87th minute of the game to give Madrid a priceless lead after <a data-player-guid=\"73e987f2-c10e-99df-8efd-677706ebab02\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/285150/eduardo-camavinga\">Eduardo Camavinga</a> laid off to him in the box for the Frenchman to tuck home into an empty net.</p>\n<p>It came after his first of the game, which was a rather fortuitous strike in the first half. A <a data-player-guid=\"4004c879-c149-3c51-a23d-75e6a66e664d\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/312015/gerard-martin\">Gerard Martín</a> attempted clearance was hit straight at Mbappé, who then finished past <a data-player-guid=\"8a56e426-8050-a1d9-5af9-73d77648d188\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/297362/joan-garcia\">Joan García</a> to give Madrid the lead. </p>\n<p>Raphina had equalized for Barça in the second half, but Mbappé's late strike secured all three points for Madrid and put them just three points behind their rivals at the top of LaLiga. It also handed Barça their first league defeat of the season. </p>\n<p>Mbappé's match-winning brace comes a day before the 2026 Ballon d'Or ceremony, an award for which the Madrid superstar is very much in the running.</p>\n<p>Mbappé has become the 24th player to reach a century of goals for Spain's most successful club and the fourth fastest, joining the likes of Alfredo di Stéfano, Raúl and <a data-player-guid=\"19e162c0-6bf5-d817-e9f9-81bf96001ee2\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/player/_/id/22774/cristiano-ronaldo\">Cristiano Ronaldo</a>, who sits top of the rankings with 450 goals in 438 matches.</p>\n<p><photo caption=\"Kylian Mbappé has joined an elite group of Real Madrid superstars.\"></p>\n<p>Despite being LaLiga's top scorer in both of his full seasons at the club, Mbappé is yet to win any trophies with Madrid, having lost out on the LaLiga title to <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"58f7c4a9-c991-4ed4-fe5c-1f833cba75b8\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/team?id=83\">Barcelona</a> in both 2024-25 and 2025-26.</p>\n<p><strong>- <a href=\"https://www.espn.co.uk/football/story/_/id/50229304/ballon-dor-industry-harry-kane-lamine-yamal-kylian-mbappe\" target=\"_blank\">What it takes to win a Ballon d'Or: Trophies, goals and playing the PR game</a><br>\n- <a href=\"https://www.espn.co.uk/football/story/_/id/50117234/barcelona-lamine-yamal-real-madrid-kylian-mbappe-clasico-star-ballon-dor\" target=\"_blank\">Barcelona's Yamal vs. Madrid's Mbappé: Which star has stronger Ballon d'Or claim?</a><br>\n- <a href=\"https://www.espn.co.uk/football/story/_/id/50166049/a-global-experiment-espn-predict-ballon-dor\" target=\"_blank\">A global experiment: Can ESPN predict the Ballon d'Or awards?</a></strong></p>\n<p>The Frenchman joined Madrid on a free transfer in June 2024 after scoring 256 goals in 308 appearances for <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"79843c9e-0fe0-63b4-b591-9affc0dbd517\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/team?id=160\">Paris Saint-Germain</a> and 27 in 60 for <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"8e37a6b1-d9b7-251c-9920-88d467d9c871\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/team?id=174\">AS Monaco</a>.</p>\n<p>The 27-year-old also became <a data-clubhouse-guid=\"81be996c-0f98-eec4-6284-c6be0d186360\" href=\"http://espn.com/soccer/team?id=478\">France</a>'s all-time leading scorer, as well as the top scorer in World Cup history, this summer.</p>\n<p><inline1></p>\n\n\n\n\n", "allowAMP": true, "allowAds": true, "allowComments": true, "allowCommerce": true, "allowContentReactions": true, "allowSearch": true, "byline": "ESPN", "isLiveBlog": false, "links": {"api": {"self": {"href": "https://content.core.api.espn.com/v1/sports/news/50246032"}}, "app": {"sportscenter": {"href": "sportscenter://x-callback-url/showStory?uid=50246032"}}, "mobile": {"href": "http://m.espn.go.com/soccer/story?storyId=50246032"}, "web": {"href": "https://www.espn.com/soccer/story/_/id/50246032/kylian-mbappe-scores-100th-goal-real-madrid-dramatic-clasico-win"}}, "premium": false}], "breakingNews": [], "timestamp": "2026-10-25T22:28:06Z", "status": "success"}